This Privacy Policy explains how Kholhang Connect (“we”, “us”, “our”) handles information when you use our iOS mobile application (the “App”).

Information we collect
We collect only the following personal information:

Account information: your email address (for login/account-related features).
We do not collect:

Photos or media from your device
Precise or approximate location
Contacts
Firebase (analytics / crash reporting)
We use Firebase to help us understand app reliability and improve performance (for example, crash reports and basic app diagnostics). Firebase may collect certain device and app information such as:

Device model and operating system version
App version
Crash logs and performance/diagnostic data
Approximate usage events needed for app stability and improvement
This information is used to maintain and improve the App and troubleshoot issues.

How we use your information
We use information to:

Create and manage your account and let you sign in
Provide and operate the App
Improve reliability and performance (including diagnosing crashes via Firebase)
Respond to support requests
Sharing of information
We do not sell your personal information. We may share information only:

With service providers that help operate the App (such as Firebase) acting on our behalf
If required by law or to protect the rights, safety, and security of users and the App
Data retention
Email/account data is kept as long as your account is active or as needed to provide the App.
Crash/diagnostic data is retained for a limited period as provided by Firebase and only as needed for improvement and troubleshooting.
Security
We use reasonable safeguards to protect information. No system is 100% secure, but we work to protect your data from unauthorized access.

Your choices and rights
You may:

Request access, correction, or deletion of your account information by emailing kholhangconnect@gmail.com
Manage app permissions in iOS Settings (the App does not require photos/location/contacts permissions based on the information provided)
Children’s privacy
The App is not intended for children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you believe a child provided an email address, contact us to request deletion.

International data transfers
Your information may be processed by service providers (including Firebase) on servers that may be located outside India. We take reasonable steps to ensure appropriate protections.

Changes to this policy
We may update this policy from time to time. We will update the “Effective date” and make the latest version available within the App or on a webpage you provide.

Contact us
If you have questions or requests, contact: kholhangconnect@gmail.com
